{"4786590": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lover Completion Plan", "steam_appid": 4786590, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786590/extras/d0f35360eda8ad6aaa939c104c0bc9f3.avif?t=1786678709\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In a vast, white, unknown space, there is only one cozy room.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having lost your memories, you meet a girl here who doesn't mind your amnesia at all—Haru. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reality and illusion blur together: outside the window is nothing but a white void; inexplicable notes appear in the room; and bizarre photos suddenly revert to normal. The anomalies in this room seem to exceed your imagination...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Until a so-called &quot;Repair Device&quot; appears. Find and report the anomalies, and everything will return to normal the next day. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>&quot;Things can be repaired... but can people be repaired too?&quot;</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique First-Person Experience:</strong> Realistic first-person movement effects combined with physical-based 3D subtitles, breaking the boundaries of traditional storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786590/extras/954f4cf641e6659db881ac67bb288fc2.poster.avif?t=1786678709\" width=1170 height=644 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786590/extras/954f4cf641e6659db881ac67bb288fc2.webm?t=1786678709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786590/extras/954f4cf641e6659db881ac67bb288fc2.mp4?t=1786678709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Different Minigames Every Day:</strong> It's not just about dialogue; different classic minigames are interspersed every day. But as you explore the game world with Haru, is there an undercurrent surging beneath the daily facade?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786590/extras/5f20a35b8099068359ea103054898f69.poster.avif?t=1786678709\" width=1140 height=686 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786590/extras/5f20a35b8099068359ea103054898f69.webm?t=1786678709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786590/extras/5f20a35b8099068359ea103054898f69.mp4?t=1786678709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meticulous Character Interactions:</strong> Featuring over 10 different facial expressions and 30+ unique animations combined with motion capture technology, delivering a lifelike character performance. (Haru won't get in your way; she will automatically avoid you.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786590/extras/a36374f903cf3e917f61cbdac5a021eb.poster.avif?t=1786678709\" width=1170 height=666 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786590/extras/a36374f903cf3e917f61cbdac5a021eb.webm?t=1786678709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786590/extras/a36374f903cf3e917f61cbdac5a021eb.mp4?t=1786678709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Choices Decide Her World:</strong> Freely choose to report different anomalies. Your observations and decisions will directly affect subsequent scene transitions and story development. You and her future are in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready? Go and &quot;complete&quot; the world she expects!</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786590/extras/d0f35360eda8ad6aaa939c104c0bc9f3.avif?t=1786678709\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In a vast, white, unknown space, there is only one cozy room.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having lost your memories, you meet a girl here who doesn't mind your amnesia at all—Haru. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reality and illusion blur together: outside the window is nothing but a white void; inexplicable notes appear in the room; and bizarre photos suddenly revert to normal. The anomalies in this room seem to exceed your imagination...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Until a so-called &quot;Repair Device&quot; appears. Find and report the anomalies, and everything will return to normal the next day. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>&quot;Things can be repaired... but can people be repaired too?&quot;</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique First-Person Experience:</strong> Realistic first-person movement effects combined with physical-based 3D subtitles, breaking the boundaries of traditional storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786590/extras/954f4cf641e6659db881ac67bb288fc2.poster.avif?t=1786678709\" width=1170 height=644 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786590/extras/954f4cf641e6659db881ac67bb288fc2.webm?t=1786678709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786590/extras/954f4cf641e6659db881ac67bb288fc2.mp4?t=1786678709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Different Minigames Every Day:</strong> It's not just about dialogue; different classic minigames are interspersed every day. But as you explore the game world with Haru, is there an undercurrent surging beneath the daily facade?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786590/extras/5f20a35b8099068359ea103054898f69.poster.avif?t=1786678709\" width=1140 height=686 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786590/extras/5f20a35b8099068359ea103054898f69.webm?t=1786678709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786590/extras/5f20a35b8099068359ea103054898f69.mp4?t=1786678709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meticulous Character Interactions:</strong> Featuring over 10 different facial expressions and 30+ unique animations combined with motion capture technology, delivering a lifelike character performance. (Haru won't get in your way; she will automatically avoid you.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786590/extras/a36374f903cf3e917f61cbdac5a021eb.poster.avif?t=1786678709\" width=1170 height=666 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786590/extras/a36374f903cf3e917f61cbdac5a021eb.webm?t=1786678709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786590/extras/a36374f903cf3e917f61cbdac5a021eb.mp4?t=1786678709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Choices Decide Her World:</strong> Freely choose to report different anomalies. Your observations and decisions will directly affect subsequent scene transitions and story development. You and her future are in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready? Go and &quot;complete&quot; the world she expects!</strong></p>", "short_description": "A 1st-person psychological horror &amp; romance adventure. Amnesiac, you're trapped in a seemingly perfect, cozy room with a girl claiming to be &quot;Haru&quot;. Find and &quot;fix&quot; anomalies through daily interaction. Each fix reveals more of the cruel truth. &quot;Complete&quot; this broken world to save her!", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Korean<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786590/60f5116562f795cd2e5a0bc59d04dbac3979b93e/header.jpg?t=1786678709", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786590/c433b55953a9fc61ce48a27947f42a33ffc634ce/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786678709", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786590/c433b55953a9fc61ce48a27947f42a33ffc634ce/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786678709", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit proc